  "body": "With its heritage charm, thoughtful modern updates and huge backyard for children to grow up in, this Devonport villa is easy to fall in love with. The current owners have called it home for 35 years and say they wouldn't have wanted to live anywhere else.\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms, two bathrooms and two living spaces are all on the main level, making everyday family life easy. The second lounge features a library, perfect for settling in with a good book, while a fourth bedroom upstairs offers a retreat for guests, a teenager, extended family or an au pair.\r\n\r\nThe lounge, dining area and kitchen flow effortlessly onto a covered louvre deck, where family dinners can turn into long evenings with friends. The built-in spa gives you another reason to linger after the plates have been cleared.\r\n\r\nBeyond the deck, the huge, level backyard is framed by established hedging for privacy. It's secure and ready for backyard cricket, a trampoline and plenty of room for children and pets to run around. The downstairs offers a separate laundry, internal access garage and additional workshop space, with room for tools, hobbies and weekend projects.\r\n\r\nCome and see why one family chose to stay for 35 years. Contact me to arrange a private viewing or join us at the open homes.\r\n\r\nCopy and paste this link into your browser to access the property documents:\r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/R8RH",
